  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Booking & contact form intake\n\nWebsite form (src/components/BookingForm.tsx) POSTs JSON here.\n\n**Why this shape**\n- No database: earlier version wrote to a `postgres` host that does not exist, the node failed, its error output was unwired, and n8n returned an empty 200. Every submission was silently lost.\n- Validation (name, email, form_type) fails fast with **400**.\n- Guest email (Resend) is best-effort: on failure we still notify staff; response carries `email_sent`.\n- Staff WhatsApp (Admin) is the critical path: success → **200 {success:true}**, failure → **502**.\n- Owner-US and guest WhatsApp are fire-and-forget (continue on error).\n- Every network node retries 3x before failing.\n\nThe website treats anything other than `{\"success\": true}` as a failure and shows the WhatsApp fallback.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "0b1c2d3e-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "README",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        96,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "submit",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "dd74b2ff-88a5-4c7f-a4ae-72703fd28958",
      "name": "Webhook Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        576,
        224
      ],
      "webhookId": "submit"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "req-name",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.name }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "req-email",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.email }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "req-form-type",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.form_type }}",
              "rightValue": "^(booking|contact)$",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "regex"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1766fe6e-2e44-4f6a-ac43-de7c2da5665d",
      "name": "Has Required Fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        800,
        224
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={\n  \"error\": \"validation_error\",\n  \"message\": \"name, email and form_type (booking|contact) are required\"\n}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 400
        }
      },
      "id": "0b1c2d3e-0000-4000-8000-000000000400",
      "name": "Respond 400 Validation Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1040,
        448
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.resend.com/emails",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
